  "blueprint": [
    "Source uses Astro; a dependency-free rebuild maps each route to a static HTML page and each component to a reusable HTML/CSS pattern (or a JS render function fed by JSON data).",
    "Recreate the design system first: 83 CSS custom properties → one `tokens.css` (:root).",
    "Dark mode exists: implement `prefers-color-scheme` + a persisted toggle (localStorage) on <html>.",
    "Interactions are bound through data-* hooks: [data-aw-toggle-color-scheme], [data-aw-gallery-prev], [data-aw-gallery-next] → keep the same hook pattern.",
    "Content lives in Markdown collections → export to a JSON array and render lists/detail views in JS.",
    "Verify with headless browser screenshots at desktop (1440px) and phone (390px) widths."
  ]
